# Cloudflare Pages redirects. GitHub Pages ignores this file.
#
# Deliberately no catch-all rule. Every page is prerendered to its own
# HTML file (dirStyle "flat"), and Cloudflare Pages already serves
# /contacto from contacto.html. An unknown URL must get 404.html with a
# real 404 status: a "/*  /index.html  200" rule here would answer every
# broken link with the home page and a 200, which Google reports as a
# soft 404. The deploy-cloudflare workflow fails if such a rule returns.
#
# The apex simpliaspain.com -> www redirect is a Cloudflare Redirect Rule
# on the zone, not a line here: this file only sees paths, not hosts.
